<title>UK: BT Effecten sets warrants on CAC 40 index.</title>
<headline>BT Effecten sets warrants on CAC 40 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued two million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the CAC 40 index, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE INDEX.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.NOV.96-06.NOV.97  PAYDATE	 20.NOV.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			SPOT REFERENCE 2135</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS, HAMBURG, MUNICH, STITTGART</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	  STRIKE     PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  2135	 4.15 DEM   6.58 PCT     15.2 X</p>
<p> PUT	   2135	 3.90 DEM   6.17 PCT     16.22 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
